Vietnamese syllable list — dict/vietnamese
==========================================

Extracted from the Debian/Ubuntu package `hunspell-vi` (version 1:24.2.1-1),
file /usr/share/hunspell/vi_VN.dic, which comes from the LibreOffice
dictionaries collection. The extraction drops the leading entry-count line and
the hunspell affix flags after "/"; no word was added, removed or altered.

Upstream-Name: libreoffice-dictionaries
